    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One man's trash is another man's treasure. A ShapeYard is where discarded shapes find new purpose. As <strong>a newcomer to recycling</strong>, your mission is to<strong> earn every recycling badge</strong> and prove yourself as a masterclass recycler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375060/extras/366bf063156af56f2771b6ec91740602.avif?t=1746552554\" width=617 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run begins with selecting one of <strong>12 unique characters</strong>, each with their <strong>own skills</strong> and <strong>special modifiers</strong>. They play a crucial role in forming your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375060/extras/5afa12a7cdc709c568911482b9431827.poster.avif?t=1746552554\" width=618 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375060/extras/5afa12a7cdc709c568911482b9431827.webm?t=1746552554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>With <strong>over 50 machines</strong> at your disposal, you can <strong>process, store, refine, and even destroy shapes</strong>. Choosing the right setup is mission-critical to maintaining a steady flow of shapes in and out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375060/extras/3e8c34881f223ed9bcd51b77aef61cd5.poster.avif?t=1746552554\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375060/extras/3e8c34881f223ed9bcd51b77aef61cd5.webm?t=1746552554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The modifiers are the <strong>hidden champions</strong> of each run. With <strong>100+ to choose from</strong>, finding the right combinations and mastering their synergies is the key to reaching the final recycling badged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375060/extras/3a236ef5713f094f4cf98474ed20a467.poster.avif?t=1746552554\" width=618 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375060/extras/3a236ef5713f094f4cf98474ed20a467.webm?t=1746552554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn, the shop offers a selection of machines, modifiers, shapes, and more. As the game progresses, the shop evolves, and earning recycling badges <strong>unlocks new items</strong> permanently. How you spend your tickets is up to you, but <strong>every purchase counts</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375060/extras/9af94ff7f613d32597070fd86c7cd951.poster.avif?t=1746552554\" width=616 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375060/extras/9af94ff7f613d32597070fd86c7cd951.webm?t=1746552554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>various types of customers</strong>, each leveling up when served. Identifying and catering to the most beneficial ones for your strategy is key to success.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One man's trash is another man's treasure. A ShapeYard is where discarded shapes find new purpose. As <strong>a newcomer to recycling</strong>, your mission is to<strong> earn every recycling badge</strong> and prove yourself as a masterclass recycler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375060/extras/366bf063156af56f2771b6ec91740602.avif?t=1746552554\" width=617 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run begins with selecting one of <strong>12 unique characters</strong>, each with their <strong>own skills</strong> and <strong>special modifiers</strong>. They play a crucial role in forming your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375060/extras/5afa12a7cdc709c568911482b9431827.poster.avif?t=1746552554\" width=618 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375060/extras/5afa12a7cdc709c568911482b9431827.webm?t=1746552554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>With <strong>over 50 machines</strong> at your disposal, you can <strong>process, store, refine, and even destroy shapes</strong>. Choosing the right setup is mission-critical to maintaining a steady flow of shapes in and out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375060/extras/3e8c34881f223ed9bcd51b77aef61cd5.poster.avif?t=1746552554\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375060/extras/3e8c34881f223ed9bcd51b77aef61cd5.webm?t=1746552554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The modifiers are the <strong>hidden champions</strong> of each run. With <strong>100+ to choose from</strong>, finding the right combinations and mastering their synergies is the key to reaching the final recycling badged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375060/extras/3a236ef5713f094f4cf98474ed20a467.poster.avif?t=1746552554\" width=618 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375060/extras/3a236ef5713f094f4cf98474ed20a467.webm?t=1746552554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn, the shop offers a selection of machines, modifiers, shapes, and more. As the game progresses, the shop evolves, and earning recycling badges <strong>unlocks new items</strong> permanently. How you spend your tickets is up to you, but <strong>every purchase counts</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375060/extras/9af94ff7f613d32597070fd86c7cd951.poster.avif?t=1746552554\" width=616 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375060/extras/9af94ff7f613d32597070fd86c7cd951.webm?t=1746552554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>various types of customers</strong>, each leveling up when served. Identifying and catering to the most beneficial ones for your strategy is key to success.</p>",
